{{!
    @template tool_vae/carry_page

    The page "Reporter une déclaration", below its heading: the refusal of a hidden record and the sentence that the text
    is kept, what a carry is, the declaration as it stands on the old record, the correspondence decided and the note of
    the administrator, the form on the new record.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\carry_page. The template holds no logic. The
    sentences are escaped (double braces). Seven keys are HTML (triple braces): noticehtml, a notification made by the
    core; originalhtml, correspondenceheadinghtml and formheadinghtml, headings made by the core (the codes escaped by the
    class); declarationhtml, drawn by the template tool_vae/declaration; correspondencehtml, a sentence of the language
    file whose two competencies are their code escaped and their label passed through format_string() of the core;
    formhtml, the form of the core ($form->render()).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * refusal - false, or {noticehtml, kept}: the record was hidden since the form was sent
    * intro - string, what a carry is
    * originalhtml - HTML, the heading of the old declaration
    * declarationhtml - HTML, the old declaration
    * correspondenceheadinghtml - HTML, the heading of the correspondence
    * correspondencehtml - HTML, the sentence of the correspondence
    * note - false, or {text}: the note of the administrator
    * formheadinghtml - HTML, the heading of the form
    * formhtml - HTML, the form

    Example context (json):
    {
        "refusal": false,
        "intro": "The record this declaration refers to has been replaced by another.",
        "originalhtml": "<h3>The declaration as it stands on record RS5000</h3>",
        "declarationhtml": "<dl class=\"tool-vae-claim\"><dt>Record</dt><dd>RS5000-C01</dd></dl>",
        "correspondenceheadinghtml": "<h3>Correspondence</h3>",
        "correspondencehtml": "Competency RS5000-C01 — Aider of the old record corresponds to RS6000-C01 — Aider.",
        "note": {"text": "Note of the administrator: same gesture."},
        "formheadinghtml": "<h3>Your declaration on record RS6000</h3>",
        "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>"
    }
}}
{{#refusal}}
{{{noticehtml}}}
<p>{{kept}}</p>
{{/refusal}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{{originalhtml}}}
{{{declarationhtml}}}
{{{correspondenceheadinghtml}}}
<p>{{{correspondencehtml}}}</p>
{{#note}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/note}}
{{{formheadinghtml}}}
{{{formhtml}}}
